Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.62,0:00:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody here\Nknows it for certain So
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes and breathe\Nin deeply And listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul. You'll see a\Npath in front of you. And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll know just where you\Nneed to go So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.36,0:00:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:01:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And make us stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way, that's what's\Nbest for me. And you do it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's got to\Nbe. We're moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,now I'm ready But at times it's okay to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,get help on the way For the future ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,burning bright For what's ahead you\Nsee Is beyond your wildest dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And make a stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The best that we know. With tears\Nand doubts and tone. We'll go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.24,0:01:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,where we all wanna go The page
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,within brings colors of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.02,0:02:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Undo the paralysis, Jutsu\NRaizo, or we'll both die!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.74,0:02:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.50,0:02:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, we're trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.33,0:02:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The heat will kill us before we get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.32,0:02:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Shinobu from the\NStraw Hats! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Head the opposite way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.48,0:03:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire hasn't spread there yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just focus on surviving!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, we'll save ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.62,0:03:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay safe too! Right! Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard the man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.10,0:03:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did the flames spread so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.98,0:03:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one thing for a\Nwarrior to die in battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but this fire will cause so\Nmany needless casualties!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.42,0:04:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous to stay here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to run to some place safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.30,0:04:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, she's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.30,0:04:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.02,0:04:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm so glad and as an added bonus now\Nyou gotta know the side effects of your
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.50,0:04:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,extended gigantification yeah i thought
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,something might happen\Nbut i didn't expect that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a fair payoff i'm\Nstronger and bigger for
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,longer but weaker and\Nsmaller once it's over
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but that reminds me there's someone\Nelse dealing with side effects
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyagi, I'm worried about\Nhow Zoro's doing. Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He had 20 or 30 bones broken and had\Ncountless other injuries on top of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The medicine healed him instantly,\Nbut doesn't last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.58,0:05:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,When it's done, he'll hurt twice as bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.54,0:05:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.92,0:05:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Those wounds were bad\Nenough in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, you better not die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.82,0:06:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.86,0:06:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't, I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.26,0:07:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't got time for this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.02,0:07:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta find Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.18,0:07:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We had this till one of\NWhitebeer's commanders stepped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.20,0:07:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell is he helping\NStraw Hat and the Samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.26,0:07:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I was sloppy. The peace pirates\Naren't to be trifled with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:08:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep them up, it's fine.\NAs long as you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.26,0:08:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cypher-pull.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, we're Aegis Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.32,0:08:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I was afraid this might happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.16,0:08:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Izo, we never saw each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,To be clear, the Whitebeard pilots\Ncommitted a historical crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not something we can simply ignore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But our business is with the Straw Hats,\Nand that is more than enough for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.28,0:08:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We are not done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.92,0:08:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,CP Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.22,0:09:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.02,0:09:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.60,0:09:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.20,0:09:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wearing our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And slips into the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.32,0:09:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do that! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.32,0:09:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Namuji?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Place your bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.06,0:10:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If that thing so much as touches those\Nexplosives, everything will be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.50,0:10:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where you came\Nfrom, but you can go right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.24,0:10:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahorama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Big Mom! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:10:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't even know Pitidore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:10:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You've won, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.40,0:11:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.88,0:11:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Even your own men are pitying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.60,0:11:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a good look for\Nthe worst generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.84,0:11:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.20,0:11:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They were bested by us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.02,0:11:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just run out a little\Nlonger and we'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I need any medics to move in and\Ntake care of the captain right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw off, you punks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a proper duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.60,0:11:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,God of lightning, Kingston, heed my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.26,0:11:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.12,0:11:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight into the rubbish\Npile, right where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.24,0:12:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.10,0:12:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Kaido would have\Nannounced his victory by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.84,0:12:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's still\Nfooling around with Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Put that brat in the ground already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.02,0:12:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just a little punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.74,0:12:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kara, let's go to the rooftop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.84,0:12:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pooped after all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma-ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Turning your back on the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,K-Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.46,0:12:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for anesthesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.42,0:12:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.18,0:13:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.84,0:13:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he just killed Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.54,0:13:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.26,0:13:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't know Traffy could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.74,0:13:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I hurt you with this last time,\Nbut the incision isn't the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.02,0:13:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.24,0:13:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, let's not be hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.24,0:13:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sharkvila!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.80,0:13:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.38,0:13:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.16,0:14:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.28,0:14:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's pulling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're steel beams, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.14,0:14:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all working for me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.38,0:14:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You've still got some fights. Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You must really want my head,\Nyou stubborn little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.84,0:14:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I did want your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but all of a sudden I feel I'm\Nbeing driven by a different purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.36,0:14:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling Kaido's\Nend is coming soon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even raindrops can wear away stone\Nif you give them long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.78,0:15:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're invincible?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.60,0:15:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You just haven't faced\Nanyone persistent enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.24,0:15:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do it! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.68,0:15:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.56,0:15:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She's super-sized and\Nit's bigger than her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.69,0:15:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, you old nasty hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:16:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna drive you straight to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.32,0:16:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.48,0:16:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in on that road!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.50,0:16:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Onigashima is moving backward!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.90,0:16:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drag it as far away\Nfrom the capital as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.42,0:16:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not harm my people!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.06,0:16:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not reach the land of\NWano so long as I draw breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.18,0:16:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Did someone call out to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.36,0:17:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing just sent her flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's not actually\Ngonna lose this, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.30,0:17:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally got you to shut up for a\Nsecond. Hey, you, you did it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.26,0:17:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,that's two times now I did a powerful\Nmove and you followed my lead with
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.20,0:17:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,something big and flashy acting\Nlike you one get your ego in check
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.64,0:17:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,because i'm not your opening act my\Nego nobody here gives a crap except you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.54,0:18:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,all right then why don't you attack\Nher first next time anybody's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,strongest technique didn't let me\Nfinish her off now screw that you're not
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.88,0:18:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,my boss besides the next move i do\Nis gonna wipe her out with or without
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.76,0:18:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you oh yeah what comes after the\Nbull a hippo an elephant SHUT UP!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.92,0:18:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I AIN'T GONNA TELL YOU CRAP!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your mouth, Law, or the\Nboss is gonna kill you next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.28,0:18:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.76,0:18:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shock waves inside my\Nbody. Oh my ribs must
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.98,0:18:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,be broken that's quite\Nthe dangerous technique
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.24,0:18:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,hear that even she thinks it's cool real\Nfunny now will you drop it already you dick
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:19:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my horse should fix things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.42,0:19:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, bows!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.08,0:19:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, life!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.30,0:19:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.54,0:19:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.20,0:19:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.86,0:19:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is serious, so listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've only got enough left\Nin me for one more attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.48,0:19:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to finish\Nthis with the next shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.74,0:19:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't intend to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.30,0:19:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So what I need you to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.82,0:19:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I just said you're not my boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.94,0:19:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Prometheus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.08,0:19:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Napoleon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.78,0:19:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.88,0:19:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Ready, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.28,0:19:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I could do this all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Major Saber!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.54,0:20:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just scraps!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.20,0:20:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.42,0:20:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This was always a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.18,0:20:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You were dead the moment\Nyou picked this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I have sunk hundreds of boats like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.24,0:20:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I was ruling when you\Nwere still in diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.72,0:20:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My power is absolute. Best.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.24,0:20:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to\Nbe an emperor of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.52,0:20:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now a side!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.76,0:20:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.90,0:20:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.04,0:20:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.76,0:20:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.66,0:20:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.02,0:21:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She used the tower to block it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a hit and drop dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.44,0:21:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.02,0:21:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You must learn your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother's visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.36,0:21:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It cannot release 3,000 leagues of misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.36,0:21:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.08,0:22:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't escape me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.42,0:22:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Our attack is chasing us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.72,0:22:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.96,0:22:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.50,0:23:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.74,0:23:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to finish them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.80,0:23:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Put those little punks\Nin the ground, misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.98,0:23:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.36,0:23:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,K-Room, Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.54,0:24:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This trick again, Trafalgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.36,0:24:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.14,0:24:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.92,0:24:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got some balls on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.62,0:24:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How long did you sit\Nhere to hold on to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.70,0:24:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.36,0:24:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Captain? Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.90,0:24:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.81,0:24:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not worth it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.64,0:24:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Deeper, deeper, just a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.64,0:24:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.34,0:24:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You really wanted me to\Nbeat you to death, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.44,0:25:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now puncture.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.68,0:25:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.98,0:25:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fylla!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.00,0:25:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.52,0:25:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A giant hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.96,0:25:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.56,0:26:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.46,0:26:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn him to ash, Misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.76,0:26:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Eustass, do it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.60,0:26:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.94,0:26:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Telling me what to do again, Trafalgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.54,0:26:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Just sit there and keep your mouth shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.40,0:26:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared of you, you nasty boy, give\Nme your worst, you can't beat Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.36,0:26:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep telling yourself that!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.68,0:26:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.80,0:26:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.86,0:26:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't rule in our era.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.14,0:27:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You pulled out all the stops this\Ntime, honestly, I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.74,0:27:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You boys must really like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.74,0:27:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want our time together to end,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.68,0:27:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,even though you can\Nbarely stand on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.28,0:27:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're young, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.12,0:27:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got lots of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.46,0:27:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm made of much\Nsterner stuff than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.12,0:27:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You plants probably thought\Nyou'd driven me to the brink.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.40,0:27:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But try as you might, you can't defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.66,0:28:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.02,0:28:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is it going to take?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.12,0:28:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been kicking her ass,\Nbut now she's laughing it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.74,0:28:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.00,0:28:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.36,0:28:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid and the captain are both spent.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.56,0:28:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.12,0:28:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I do, your miserable little\Nlives will be putty in my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.02,0:28:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll grant you what mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.38,0:28:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You may choose your punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.54,0:28:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to hand over\N50 years of your lifespan?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.66,0:28:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Or would you rather stay\Nas you are and be my slave?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.24,0:28:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Will it be life or slave?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.38,0:28:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your son of a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.62,0:28:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.30,0:28:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta book it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.12,0:28:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.50,0:29:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She's taking her life back to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.28,0:29:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! My life! My life!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.57,0:29:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say anything but this!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.48,0:29:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought she was gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.40,0:29:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then she turns around and does this!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.82,0:29:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.26,0:29:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.72,0:29:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from here, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.54,0:29:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys should run.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.54,0:29:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.08,0:29:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,She thinks I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.14,0:29:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving you a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.72,0:29:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll never be your slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.14,0:29:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just a bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.66,0:29:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got one foot in\Nthe grave, you old hag,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.52,0:29:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and your half-assed threats\Ndon't intimidate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.76,0:29:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.46,0:30:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a second of their\Nlifespan has been taken away!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.76,0:30:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's everywhere on the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.52,0:30:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me they're\Nnot scared at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.00,0:30:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Roronoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.78,0:30:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As much as I'd like to relish my victory,\Nthe dying screams will probably ruin it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.86,0:30:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless I do this, a gift\Nfrom the man who saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.58,0:30:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being such a sore loser\Nand take a hit, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.36,0:30:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The underworld is waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.58,0:30:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help you on your way! It's silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.86,0:30:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.80,0:30:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong with my ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.36,0:30:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Scream into the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.20,0:30:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.88,0:30:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This technique cancels out all sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.72,0:30:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, didn't catch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.22,0:31:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.52,0:31:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My voice is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.46,0:31:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, look behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.60,0:31:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And one more for the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.98,0:31:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump off!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.34,0:31:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Prometheus, Hera, what are you doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.34,0:31:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,why aren't you helping me,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.12,0:32:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,what,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.92,0:32:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,that big mom, what happened,\Neverything's silent,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.84,0:32:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing I touch makes a sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.16,0:32:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell have you\Ndone to me, Trafalgar?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.20,0:32:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.62,0:32:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.32,0:32:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.34,0:32:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.44,0:32:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.74,0:32:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse those stupid brats.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.98,0:33:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And curse you too, Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.78,0:33:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You just couldn't keep\Nyour mouth shut. Why the
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.20,0:33:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,hell did you have to go and\Nsay that before you died
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.64,0:33:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,so you all want my treasure well you\Ncan go ahead and have it it's out there
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.46,0:33:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,i left it in one place now\Nyou just have to find it
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.64,0:33:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,People ain't bad up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.70,0:33:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world bought into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.16,0:33:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You've started the\Nso-called great pirate era.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.36,0:33:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But what do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.70,0:33:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.84,0:33:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your problem, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.86,0:34:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All these brats got fired up thanks\Nto your little speech, Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.04,0:34:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And the pirates you left\Nbehind from your generation,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.14,0:34:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,we're the ones who have to deal with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.30,0:34:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound good!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.80,0:34:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to leave now!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.16,0:34:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.50,0:34:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.88,0:34:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.52,0:34:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.43,0:34:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.76,0:35:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.67,0:35:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.46,0:35:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.22,0:35:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.62,0:35:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,it's not fair otter you should have told
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.50,0:35:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,us before you left this\Nworld the one piece
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.24,0:35:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,is the treasure even real\Nwhat is it where is it
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.06,0:35:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,it could be right beneath my\Nnose and i wouldn't have a clue
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.70,0:35:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.92,0:36:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.16,0:36:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this. My story
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.40,0:36:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't over It can't be Not like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.38,0:36:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,dammit I won't die Not from this!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.08,0:36:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, I will be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.06,0:36:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle between Emperor of the Sea\NBig Mom and the New Generation has ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.30,0:36:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,On the performance\Nfloor. Inside the Skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.54,0:36:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dome A cheer rings out\NThe winners are clear
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.38,0:36:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,After a desperate struggle\NEustass Captain Kidd
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.94,0:37:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And his ally The Surgeon of Death
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.42,0:37:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar Law are victorious at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.28,0:37:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.42,0:37:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.70,0:37:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You beat a new prophecy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.30,0:37:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.72,0:37:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A really big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.56,0:37:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.47,0:37:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But why have you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.92,0:37:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.92,0:37:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This will do for now, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.16,0:37:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.07,0:37:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you could do it,\NMomonosuke! Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.30,0:37:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.48,0:38:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the basement? Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.36,0:38:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's exposed!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.20,0:38:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a real mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.92,0:38:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom just set off a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.78,0:38:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It blew out half the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.22,0:38:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw the explosion earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.88,0:38:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So that was her doing, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.28,0:38:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.19,0:38:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lucky the whole armory didn't explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.38,0:38:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to freeze everything,\Nso we should be safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.16,0:38:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.07,0:38:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see that you are unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.60,0:38:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still fighting to do my part,\Nbut I need to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.68,0:38:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a very large visitor coming
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.18,0:38:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with Zunesha?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.66,0:38:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The giant elephant?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.34,0:38:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The same one Odin wrote\Nabout in his journal?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.28,0:38:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.56,0:39:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Zunesha was a companion of Joy Boy\Nwho committed a crime 800 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.58,0:39:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What could it all mean?
